l_appeals_count": 1507, "received_works": [{"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/556", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 1460138, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05b14446/uploads/origins/5e0b8744-9bfd-4504-89a3-bdac8b8db9a8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98ba960d59ed8fee667858a377eee94c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05b14446/uploads/origins/5e0b8744-9bfd-4504-89a3-bdac8b8db9a8?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0cef4c82f8340a4ebd23c3e13f814503", "src_set": ""}, "body": "今回もまたよろしくお願いします！今回は友人へのプレゼントで、秋をテーマにした鹿と狐のハイブリッドの女の子です。今回はテーマがないので、楽しんでもらえると嬉しいです。また近いうちにあなたの作品を拝見できることを楽しみにしています。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JHulVUTRyPqR8U-coszxDNhfYE5Ganc9?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JHulVUTRyPqR8U-coszxDNhfYE5Ganc9?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/555", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8a586ba1/uploads/origins/7f7be97c-2a4e-4439-9089-300968a92947?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c6e901999e5559892d28b0266b5ec946", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/554", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 2546050, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7d32f8b/uploads/origins/3cc3d87a-8b09-443d-bec1-14b53e5ebc3e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64d84f50f19304334f9378b62bf84bfe", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7d32f8b/uploads/origins/3cc3d87a-8b09-443d-bec1-14b53e5ebc3e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=006b344b553c88a1a6d7c57902c7600e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！前回の作品も素晴らしかったので、またぜひお願いしたいです！\n\n私の2人のキャラクターを一緒に描いてほしいです！テーマはエメラルドとか緑色の宝石に関係してるので、それを取り入れてもらえたら最高です！それ以外はお任せします！\n\n男性キャラクターは、参考資料のように真っ白で赤い輪郭です！色がついていないと思われたかもしれないので、はっきりさせておこうと思いました。\n\nできれば1:1の正方形の比率にしてほしいのですが、そうでなくても構いません :)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1J2joI7ZE5zeehdX6hhwMDcWaMRvoYb3R?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/553", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 1650088, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e4f6cef/uploads/origins/67e15d76-09af-463e-b758-e37a0b3954f4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efb510cacebfd4c5929379b325b73c79", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e4f6cef/uploads/origins/67e15d76-09af-463e-b758-e37a0b3954f4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed0c80f2ce6a20fc0c4226e6ef39bb23", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I was very happy with this commission you made for me and I'd love to request another animation again! https://skeb.jp/@8bitfrog/works/461\n\nI would love to request a loopable animation that shows her in different poses and expressions. I would like if all were expressive, stylish, dynamic, preferably from the knee up. If not too much to ask for again, could you please sync it to this song?\n\nhttps://soundcloud.com/xxxxzomb/covergirlid/s-sTSfTyH9nWr\n\nThe song tempo is 134 BP\n\nThis is my character: https://imgur.com/a/EeNIvX4\nHer special features are circled around her in the reference sheet\n\nPlease draw her without cleavage and with a medium chest size\n\nThank you so much for considering my request, and please excuse me for bothering your busy schedule! I'd love to use the finished animation for my music and SNS again if that is okay, I'll of course credit you wherever I can! If the amount is not adequate, please resend\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/EeNIvX4", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/552", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 1239140, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/da2312dd/uploads/origins/ada398a9-048a-4ebf-90d4-c96ac4709284?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ef83997d11d027e76d8552fcc072b84", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/da2312dd/uploads/origins/ada398a9-048a-4ebf-90d4-c96ac4709284?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=54cbf6b02a99f8c3827757d73ef7266e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I'm Saiko and I just wanted to say how much I LOVE your art style and animation! I would be so honored if you could draw the pixeled animation HOWEVER make it more horror style?\n\nMy vtuber is a Clown very devious, crazy and psycho and her whole theme is circus! We love horror so if you can make it super spooky that would be amazing! My symbol circles DO SPIN (on top of my hat) also a big detail is my skull eyes, please don't forget them!\n\nFor poses, I sent 1 face expression and a pose and was hoping for waist up!\n\nThank you so much for taking to time to read all this and hope to work with you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1YXy7Ya2kLFwpoz-tkCGEYVlcU2zFgIFv/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/551", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 888672, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dcc9ed21/uploads/origins/f16ecf3e-1c61-4dd9-8320-96777ef8cdd4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=633d8cd092976e115a7184a754c8efb4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dcc9ed21/uploads/origins/f16ecf3e-1c61-4dd9-8320-96777ef8cdd4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=74b5ac92e8a626abc936a17cd106a532", "src_set": ""}, "body": "またまたMEGOさん、こんにちは！\n前回のスケブでMEGOさんの作品がとても気に入ったので、今回もお願いしたいと思います！\n\n今回は、夜の芝生に座って流れ星を見ている横顔か後ろ姿をお願いします。尻尾も1本だけ振ってください！\nhttps://skeb.jp/@8bitfrog/works/434 のような雰囲気でもいいかもしれません。\n\n左上に「Thanks for watching!\n\nありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cSv3lM0xZHmkEZOdeL8TB3woOxIMR9qR", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/550", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 888672, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bad57d55/uploads/origins/b2f5a549-dbf5-42a8-a4b4-7ffc863744d0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae6b93728c8940ec002dd5c57f126a1f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bad57d55/uploads/origins/b2f5a549-dbf5-42a8-a4b4-7ffc863744d0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=66b13494e06c35e6185849243c42c99d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "MEGOさん、こんにちは！初めてのスケブです！\n私のVtuberキャラクター、歌うことが大好きなハッピーな宇宙9尾の狐の女の子を描いてください！\nできればこの作品と同じような感じでお願いします：\nhttps://skeb.jp/@8bitfrog/works/532\n同じようなポーズ、グリッチやフリップエフェクトなし、9本のしっぽが全部出ている状態でも構いません！\n\n背景については、私のVtuberのテーマは宇宙、星、銀河に関連しているので、そのようなものでしょうか？\nhttps://skeb.jp/@8bitfrog/works/434。\n\nもしお願いしてよければ、左下に「New Game」と「Continue」ボタンがあり、選択は「New Game」でできる別バージョンもお願いできますか？古典的なRPGメーカーのゲーム（Ib、Mad Fatherなど）のメインメニューに似ています！\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cSv3lM0xZHmkEZOdeL8TB3woOxIMR9qR", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/549", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 2661101, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e19d466/uploads/origins/931a02b0-cfc8-4260-b427-467299167cb3?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=07f3eb3308162e0db0f663c3cf514e17", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e19d466/uploads/origins/931a02b0-cfc8-4260-b427-467299167cb3?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ea97e078d0cea90adb94e171389b252", "src_set": ""}, "body": "お世話になります。\nVTuberの美月ももと申します。\nTLで動くイラストを拝見してとても素敵だと思ったのでリクエストを送らせていただきました。\n\n【イラストについて】\n資料をご確認いただき、「音楽を聴いてノッている」ループアニメを描いていただけると嬉しいです！\nヒト・ネコ形態と3種類の衣装がありますが、今回はネコ形態×お好きな衣装でお願いします！\n※猫耳でヘッドホンだと変な位置になると思うので、スピーカーか何かで聴いている感じかなと思っています…！\n\n背景は電脳空間みたいなところで、猫耳と尻尾がリズムに乗って動いていると嬉しいです。\n\n【用途について】\n個人鑑賞以外に、SNSや配信活動での利用をご許可いただきたく存じます。\n※自分の音楽を付けて、動画の速さをBPMに合わせたプレビュー動画みたいなものが作れたらいいなと思いました！\n\n以上、よろしくお願い申し上げます。\n\n美月もも\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1154e63FJBrSCF2C_G-mC-Y0pCRUHJpel", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/548", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 72875, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b33fd3ef/uploads/origins/ed0daa99-094c-484c-8e85-85b9ef3aaee2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8be9a224ab9bec24c6c0d4efe09d2748", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b33fd3ef/uploads/origins/ed0daa99-094c-484c-8e85-85b9ef3aaee2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=84d3df57221a70a02bfe3bbcde3e783d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして\n素敵なドットアニメーションを拝見し、リクエストさせていただきました\n自分のオリジナルキャラクターでありVtuberの\nりょうちゃんを描いていただきたいです\n\n・資料\n明るく元気で、歌が得意な女の子です\nhttps://susuke329.wixsite.com/susuke/ryo\n\n・使用用途\n鑑賞と\nVtuber本人(りょう)によるSNSとYoutubeなどの配信での使用\n\n・詳細\nサイズは16:9（1920×1080）\n以下作品のようなバストアップで顔が良く見える構図が希望です\nhttps://skeb.jp/@8bitfrog/works/449\nhttps://skeb.jp/@8bitfrog/works/536\n\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします\n\nhttps://susuke329.wixsite.com/susuke/ryo", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/547", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 3600728, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3aaa4a3/uploads/origins/e9fdffd2-d36b-438c-995b-b961cd0a448f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12cb3de79559b1263e267097a262bb6e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3aaa4a3/uploads/origins/e9fdffd2-d36b-438c-995b-b961cd0a448f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e7e7a7df197081612ef11c45b8c9a17", "src_set": ""}, "body": "めご MEGO様\nはじめまして。個人Vtuberのちくわと申します。\nめご MEGO様の