s=bbb8e368251d717b35e5a4b7073b1621", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I am a big fan of Chiaki Katsumi. She mentioned recently that she had a skeb commission with you that was not able to be completed in time, and I was hoping to see if I could pay to get that commission finished. She was really looking forward to it and I know she would really love to see it completed. She mentioned several times how excited she was for it, so I would really like for it to still be made for her despite the complications.\n\nThank you for your consideration and have a wonderful day!", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/543", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 61100, "client_id": 3576537, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/edba780c/uploads/origins/b48436c9-01a6-4b40-bfa3-3e1ec681f488?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=038cf21e3bc91181c67c8abd71a22aed", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/edba780c/uploads/origins/b48436c9-01a6-4b40-bfa3-3e1ec681f488?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfd63d6a40ec14f9bccb1432d4cde569", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、あなたのピクセルアートアニメーションのファンです！\n\n私のVtuberのBluwunkがパソコンに座ってゲームをしているポーズのアニメーションをお願いしたいです。\n\n彼女の表情が入れ替わったり反転したりするような、あなたの以前の作品https://skeb.jp/@8bitfrog/works/525 のようなものを希望します。\n\n元の表情はハッピーな感じ。\n二番目の表情は怒っている\n\n可能であれば、私のキャラクターの黒いジャケットがあるバージョンとないバージョンを作ってください。また、背景を透明にしたバージョンもお願いします！\n\n背景やその他の詳細はお任せします :D\n\n私のキャラクターとポーズの参考資料です：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1cbSMDMs1Coon4Pk_qxKwtnl34A_AYGOx?ths=true\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8bitfrog/works/542", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, 